// The retail client's "dialog" command on zoo: a floating window titled "Test dialog",
// its label showing the dlgtext cvar, Ok and Cancel. Chained client commands. Retail
// shows only the first floating window a run opens (probe-tlist has ui_testlist), and
// crashes on quitting with one open.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 2
stuffcmd "set dlgtext \"Do you really want to do this?\"; dialog \"Test dialog\" dlgtext \"echo dialog ok\"; wait 30; screenshot; wait 30; quit"
end
